[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u738B\u90FD\u306E\u5E83\u5834\u306B\u3001\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u900F\u304D\u901A\u308B\u58F0\u304C\u97FF\u304F\u3002\n\u3000\u8074\u8846\u306F\u9759\u307E\u308A\u8FD4\u308A\u3001\u5834\u304C\u5F7C\u5973\u306B\u652F\u914D\u3055\u308C\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Diona\u0027s crystal-clear voice echoes across the capital\u0027s plaza.\nThe audience falls silent, completely under her spell.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u6B4C\u3067\u8A9E\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u306F\u3001\u767D\u591C\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u30E6\u30CA\u306E\u3053\u3068\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The song tells the tale of Juna, Knight of the Midnight Sun.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u6570\u3005\u306E\u7ADC\u3092\u5012\u3057\u305F\u82F1\u96C4\u3067\u3001\u304B\u306E\u6709\u540D\u306A\u5192\u967A\u8005\n\u3000\u30E4\u30B9\u30DF\u30FC\u30F3\u306E\u5F1F\u5B50\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A hero who has slain countless dragons, and the renowned\ndisciple of the famous adventurer Yasmine.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5DF1\u3092\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u5F8B\u3057\u3001\u7406\u60F3\u306E\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u7ACB\u3061\u3001\n\u3000\u6C11\u3092\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308B\u3082\u306E\u304B\u3089\u5B88\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(One who holds herself to the strictest standards,\nstanding as an ideal knight who protects the people from all threats.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u3093\u306A\u30E6\u30CA\u306E\u6982\u7565\u304C\u8A9E\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u304F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Such is the overview of Juna being sung.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u307E\u3068\u3081\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3068\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3063\u3066\u3059\u3054\u3044\u5974\u3060\u3088\u306A\u3002\n\u30DE\u30B8\u3067\u5BD3\u8A71\u306E\u4E3B\u4EBA\u516C\u3060\u305C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When you put it all together like that, Juna\u0027s pretty amazing.\nShe\u0027s literally like someone out of a legend!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u3092\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3002\u79C1\u3060\u3063\u3066\u666E\u901A\u306E\u4EBA\u9593\u3060\u305E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you saying? I\u0027m just a normal person."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u666E\u6BB5\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u63A5\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u305F\u3061\u306F\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3051\u3069\u3055\uFF1F\n\u666E\u901A\u306E\u4EBA\u305F\u3061\u306B\u306F\u6050\u308C\u591A\u3044\u5B58\u5728\u306A\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Those of us who work with you might know that, but...\nTo regular folk, you must seem quite intimidating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3042\u3001\u4ECA\u5BB5\u6B4C\u3046\u306F\u6211\u3089\u304C\u9A0E\u58EB\u306E\u307E\u3060\u898B\u306C\u59FF\u3002\n\u6C11\u306E\u77E5\u3089\u306C\u82F1\u96C4\u306E\u59FF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And now, tonight I shall sing of our knight\u0027s unseen side.\nThe hero unknown to the common folk!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3001\u6D41\u308C\u304C\u5909\u308F\u3063\u305F\u306D\u3002\u4F55\u304C\u8A9E\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, the story\u0027s taking a turn! I wonder what we\u0027ll hear next!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u9759\u304B\u306B\u805E\u3051\u3002\u307E\u3060\u6B4C\u306E\u6700\u4E2D\u3060\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Be quiet. The song isn\u0027t over yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3058\u3081\u306B\u8A9E\u308B\u306F\u82F1\u96C4\u306E\u4E00\u65E5\u3002\n\u3042\u3069\u3051\u306A\u304D\u59FF\u3067\u59CB\u307E\u308B\u591C\u660E\u3051\u306E\u935B\u932C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, I shall tell of our hero\u0027s daily life.\nOf dawn\u0027s training, begun with such an innocent appearance..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3069\u3051\u306A\u304D\u59FF\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Innocent appearance?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u5F85\u3066\u3002\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5F85\u3066\uFF01\n\u307E\u3055\u304B\u3042\u308C\u3092\u6B4C\u3046\u3064\u3082\u308A\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, wait. Just wait!\nShe\u0027s not going to sing about THAT, is she!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3001\u305D\u3093\u306A\u614C\u3066\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What\u0027s got you so worked up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u306E\u6B4C\u306E\u5185\u5BB9\u2026\u2026\u3053\u308C\u306F\u5BC6\u7740\u53D6\u6750\u306E\u6642\u306E\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This song\u0027s content... it\u0027s from that coverage interview...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3042\u3042\u2026\u2026\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u304C\n\u935B\u932C\u306E\u53D6\u6750\u3092\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3068\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*yawn*... Diona said she wanted to cover\nmy training session today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u591C\u660E\u3051\u306E\u65E9\u3044\u6642\u9593\u306B\u547C\u3073\u51FA\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306F\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had her come at dawn, but\nI wonder if she\u0027ll be alright..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3001\u304A\u5F85\u305F\u305B\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026\u3042\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m sorry I kept you waiting... Oh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u5BDD\u5DFB\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lady Juna, you\u0027re still in your pajamas..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6642\u9593\u304C\u60DC\u3057\u3044\u3001\u4ECA\u306F\u3053\u308C\u3067\u3044\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time is precious. This will do for now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u5BDD\u5DFB\u306E\u307E\u307E\u935B\u932C\u3092\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you always train in your nightwear?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3093\u306A\u65E9\u3044\u6642\u9593\u3060\u3002\u8AB0\u3082\u898B\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3057\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s early. Nobody\u0027s watching anyway."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u79C1\u304C\u898B\u3066\u307E\u3059\u3088\u3002\n\u3075\u3075\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u5BDD\u5DFB\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m watching today.\nHeehee, those are such cute pajamas."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u79C1\u3082\u4E00\u76EE\u898B\u305F\u6642\u306B\n\u7D76\u5BFE\u6B32\u3057\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\u306F\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aren\u0027t they? When I first saw them,\nI just knew I had to have them... Ah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3001\u6BCD\u306E\u304A\u3055\u304C\u308A\u3060\uFF01\n\u65AD\u3058\u3066\u79C1\u304C\u9078\u3093\u3067\u8CB7\u3063\u305F\u308F\u3051\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I mean, they\u0027re hand-me-downs from my mother!\nI absolutely did not choose and buy them myself!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3075\u3075\u3001\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Heehee, I see, I understand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u306E\u51FA\u6765\u4E8B\u304C\u6B4C\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She\u0027s singing about that incident...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3001\u5BDD\u5DFB\u3067\u935B\u932C\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, you train in your pajamas...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3001\u307E\u3055\u304B\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u6B4C\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3068\u306F\u3002\n\u3044\u3001\u4ECA\u304B\u3089\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u3092\u6B62\u3081\u3066\u3084\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I can\u0027t believe she\u0027d put that in a song.\nI-I\u0027ll stop Diona right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3001\u7686\u304C\u3046\u3063\u3068\u308A\u3068\u805E\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, everyone\u0027s listening in complete rapture, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u2026\u2026\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u307E\u3055\u304B\u4ECA\u65E5\u306E\u6B4C\u306F\u3059\u3079\u3066\n\u3053\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...! Don\u0027t tell me today\u0027s entire song\nis going to be like this!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3042\u3042\u2026\u2026\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u304C\n\u935B\u932C\u306E\u53D6\u6750\u3092\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3068\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*yawn*... Diona said she wanted to cover\nmy training session today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u591C\u660E\u3051\u306E\u65E9\u3044\u6642\u9593\u306B\u547C\u3073\u51FA\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306F\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I had her come at dawn, but\nI wonder if she\u0027ll be alright..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll be fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\uFF01\uFF1F\u3000\u3044\u3064\u306E\u9593\u306B\u90E8\u5C4B\u306B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona!? When did you get in my room!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8CB4\u65B9\u3092\u304A\u5F85\u305F\u305B\u3057\u3066\u306F\u3044\u3051\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\u3089\n\u3057\u3070\u3089\u304F\u524D\u306B\u306F\u99B3\u305B\u53C2\u3058\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I couldn\u0027t keep you waiting,\nso I arrived quite some time ago."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304B\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA\u306E\u6C17\u914D\u3092\u8EAB\u8FD1\u306B\u611F\u3058\u3066\u3044\u305F\u304C\n\u307E\u3055\u304B\u90E8\u5C4B\u306B\u3044\u308B\u3068\u306F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I felt your presence nearby, but\nI never thought you were actually in my room..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3041\u3044\u3044\u3002\u306F\u3058\u3081\u308B\u3068\u3059\u308B\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, never mind. Shall we begin?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u5BDD\u5DFB\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lady Juna, you\u0027re still in your pajamas..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]